                                Dec 16, 2021 - 14:45
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-medium text-success">$674.63</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-navy-100">
                                Kartina West
                            </p>
